## 6. Gap register (honest — fix in P6)

| ID | Gap | EPIC | Fix |
| -- | --- | ---- | --- |
| G-P6-UI-01 | Portal `globals.css` missing `@app-tour/design-tokens/guest-shell.css` | P6-1 | ✅ `guest-shell.css` + tailwind bridge |
| G-P6-UI-02 | Marketing `globals.css` same | P6-1 | ✅ Same |
| G-P6-UI-03 | Portal uses inline `#f8fafc` fallbacks | P6-1 | ✅ Token semantics (`var(--*)`) |
| G-P6-UI-04 | Registration flow logic inline in 550-line TSX | P6-1 | ✅ `features/auth/public-registration-logic.ts` |
| G-P6-UI-05 | OTP component duplicated web/portal | P6-1 | ✅ shared `@app-tour/ui-primitives/otp-segment-input-logic` |
| G-P6-UI-06 | No `denali-portal.css` / `denali-marketing.css` guest skins | P6-1 | ✅ Workspace skins + manifest `guestThemeStylesheets` |
| G-P6-UI-07 | No canonical file-tree gate | P6-1 | ✅ `p6-theming-file-tree.md` + `p6-theming-file-tree.spec.ts` |
| G-P6-UI-08 | Portal dev host cross-origin (`*.portal.localhost` → `localhost:3003`) | P6-1 | ✅ `apps/portal/next.config.ts` `allowedDevOrigins` + `guest-theme-stack.spec.ts` |
| G-P6-CAT-01 | Marketing `pluginId` forks for list/detail/register | P6-1 | ✅ workspace-sdk `resolve-catalog-*.ts` + SDK-CAT specs in `p6:gate` |

---

## 7. P6 checklist before merging UI

```text
□ globals.css: guest-shell + tailwind only (no page rules)
□ workspace-guest-theme-stylesheets.generated imported in layout
□ body: data-app-surface + data-workspace-plugin + data-tenant-id
□ ui-primitives subpath only (eslint)
□ logic in src/features/* — page < 150 lines compose
□ BFF route — no client API base URL
□ next-intl keys in fa + en
□ data-* test hooks preserved or extended
□ guard:public-catalog-m17 + SDK-CAT + registration intake specs in p6:gate + p4:gate
□ No new imports from packages/workspaces/* in apps except allowed workspace HTTP types
```

